  "module": "tpc_strike canon (float form rebuilt 2026-09-22)",
  "note": "canon() writes a double as C printf %.12g. PHP's sprintf('%.12g') writes exponents differently ('2.0e-9' for '2e-09'), so both residences build the string from the digits of %.11e. -0.0 is written 0. Both residences MUST reproduce every expect."
 },
